MACRO                                                                           
WY2000P4. PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
*---  ADJUST TWO DATE FIELDS IN YY-DDD FORMAT (5 DIGITS),                       
*---  SO DATES BETWEEN 1950-2049 COME IN ASCENDING SEQUENCE.                    
*---  VALUE ZERO IS CONSIDERED A NON-DATE AND NOT ADJUSTED.                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP1-YYDDD NOT ZERO AND +                                               
        TMP1-YYDDD < 99999                                                      
       IF TMP1-YYDDD < 50000                                                    
         TMP1-YYDDD = TMP1-YYDDD + 50000                                        
       ELSE                                                                     
         TMP1-YYDDD = TMP1-YYDDD - 50000                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     IF TMP2-YYDDD NOT ZERO AND +                                               
        TMP2-YYDDD < 99999                                                      
       IF TMP2-YYDDD < 50000                                                    
         TMP2-YYDDD = TMP2-YYDDD + 50000                                        
       ELSE                                                                     
         TMP2-YYDDD = TMP2-YYDDD - 50000                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
